rolling teacher runner); student_transfer.py applies to the frozen v5 source.
Build the overlay: copy those two bases plus rolling_bucket_checkpoints.py (as
remote_checkpoints.py) into <candidate>/candidate/scripts/pocket_training/, apply
this patch there, then run scripts/Pocket-FullAStudent.py prepare --candidate <candidate>.

